{"version":1,"content":"<p>【死不瞑目 😓】終於打破 Steve Jobs 長年禁忌！</p><p>Apple 29 日正式推出了首部具備觸控屏幕的 MacBook 產品，宣告正式跨入觸控筆電時代。</p><p>全新 MacBook Pro 提供 14 吋與 16 吋兩種規格，全面搭載 M5 Pro 與 M5 Max 晶片，建議售價由 2,899 美元起，即日起接受預訂並於 11 月 6 日正式出貨。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:15.866430+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:17:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T18:58:11.410424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.133086+00:00","content_hash":"02ec41c2fa0850e2159808dc6b2564f212918f48c8baf5d77d7153feeb62fdd2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}